{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2148","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Sublime Sequence"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Farmer John has an integer $$$x$$$. He creates a sequence of length $$$n$$$ by alternating integers $$$x$$$ and $$$-x$$$, starting with $$$x$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, if $$$n = 5$$$, the sequence looks like: $$$x, -x, x, -x, x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"He asks you to find the sum of all integers in the sequence."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 100$$$)  — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of input for each test case is two integers $$$x$$$ and $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq x, n \\leq 10$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output the sum of all integers in the sequence."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n1 4\n2 5\n3 6\n4 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n2\n0\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"2148A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2148/problem/A"}